  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Finely chop brown onion.\n• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 3-4 mins.\n• Add garlic seasoning, the water, arborio rice and vegetable stock. Bring to boil, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62fee64bf60c91012d047b4c/step-d5f2241e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto to a large baking dish.\n• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62fee64bf60c91012d047b4c/step-83cd269c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook mushrooms until browned and softened, 8-10 mins.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 min. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62fee64bf60c91012d047b4c/step-e1b0dd5d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir parmesan cheese, butter, baby spinach and mushrooms through risotto.\n• Add splash of water to loosen risotto if needed. Season to taste.\n• Divide risotto between bowls. Sprinkle over flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62fee64bf60c91012d047b4c/step-06da6cbc.jpg"
    }
  ]
